# <type>(<scope>): <subject>   (<= ~72 chars, imperative, no trailing period)
#
# <blank line>
# <body: what & why, not how; wrap at ~72 chars>
#
# <blank line>
# <footer: BREAKING CHANGE: ..., Refs: #123, etc.>
#
# --- Conventional Commits 1.0.0 -------------------------------------------------
# type:   feat | fix | docs | refactor | test | build | ci | chore | perf | style | revert
# scope:  optional, free-form area, e.g. (brand), (checkout), (admin), (deps)
# break:  add "!" after type/scope (feat!: ...) and/or a "BREAKING CHANGE:" footer
#
# Examples:
#   feat(shop): list the products of a brand
#   fix(brand): fall back to a 1:1 attribute mapping when none is configured
#   build: raise the minimum PHP version to 8.3
#   docs: document the installation steps
#
# Record notable changes in CHANGELOG.md under [Unreleased].
# See docs/adr-log/0008-conventional-commits.md
